  "description": "TXN-LOCAL, conflict timing with timestamps (r-txn-1/local-option-retry kept none). Process a holds a transaction on row 1. Process b makes the conflicting UPDATE of row 1 (dbFailOnError, Errors before/after) three times with engine defaults, three times after SetOption(dbLockRetry 1, dbLockDelay 1), twice after (dbLockRetry 20, dbLockDelay 250) and three times after SetOption(dbPageTimeout 100), each attempt bracketed by Signal marks that carry the timestamps. a then rolls back; b retries and reads; a reads after a pause and Idle. Asks the refusal time per setting and whether it repeats.",
